Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（500，500）\pos（966.4，758）}异形魔怪\N\N\N\N{\fnArial\fs30}尖叫岛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎物接近射杀区\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prey's approaching the kill box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动毒镖弹，打开保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate the poison darts. Safeties off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recharge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在哪里，我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever you are, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们竟然没干掉那怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe we didn't kill that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说啊，明明被狠狠击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. We hit it hard, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人说过能轻易干掉这只猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one said it was gonna be easy to take this prey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们希望有挑战性 各位，这就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we wanted a challenge, gentlemen, and, well, we got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天会逮到这小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna bag this little baby tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得合理吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}this feel right to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很扫兴 但我们会除掉它，怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's disappointing, but we'll get him. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用超高剂量特强K他命射中它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we hit that thing with a serious dose of special k,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它却没反应，不当一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he just shook it off like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级掠食动物有个坏习惯 就是命很硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super predators have a bad habit of being tough as nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoof! Tough hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些矽谷的肉脚文青猎人没战利品了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No trophy mount for these slack-jawed hipster hunters from silicon valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可是花大钱参加打猎行程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, they paid big money for this hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I should hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀遗传密码被篡改的超级掠食动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how often do you get to hunt a super predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种机会不多吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose genetic code's been hacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是强到爆的超级掠食动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mega-super predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更过瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,修改物种演化结果，让一群园区宅男\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you tinkered with evolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有新奇的战利品挂在办公室墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}so a bunch of tech geeks could hang exotic trophy mounts on their office walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.30,0:04:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈对极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bloody right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是大老远来射泥靶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't come all this way to shoot Clay pigeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.51,0:04:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，安娜，我们一起猎杀过很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Anna. We've been in a lot of hunts together,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次没什么两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this one's no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，但之前是真的打猎 比尔，不是圈养狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but those were fair fights, bill, not vanity hunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，安娜，你在不爽什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. What's going on, Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次就是不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something about this hunt just doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等明天干掉这小家伙 你会觉得好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna put this baby down tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll feel better then. You always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，去喝点高价美酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come on, let's go drink some expensive booze,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,带那些矽谷小丑吃喝玩乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and show these silicon valley jokers a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，你会玩得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You're gonna enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，我们离开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boys, let's move on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备了烤牛排 冰箱还有冰凉伏特加\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got some steaks on the grill and some cold vodka in the freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才对嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（634，907.8）}艾维克斯生技 野生动物保育站17号
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}雪菲尔，巴塞隆纳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}维克特莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，以希曼！ - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ishiman! Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Hello…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有感觉到吗？ - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是火山岛，只是一些轻微地震活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Volcanic island. Just some minor seismic activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要的话，我调资料给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want, I'll wrangle up the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Do that, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.31,0:07:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在休养生息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们昨晚玩丢铜板、喝酒脱衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}We played flip, sip or strip last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服还没脱，他就喝挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even make it past sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧，吉米 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Jimmy. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的搞屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fart in a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的组员今天应该在 帮象群安装定位标签吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My team's supposed to be GPS tagging the elephants today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错过了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I missing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，有加奶精吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely. Cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.14,0:07:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两颗糖 - 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two sugars. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你宿醉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hungover?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.23,0:07:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在生气吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，但你的组员 在那里包办所有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But your crew is doing all the work over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们的应尽职责吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's kind of what they're supposed to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:08:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，但是你才有保育生物博士学位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, but you're the one with the phd in conservation biology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，小洁，我懂了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, jas. I get it. I get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但换这个角度看\N{\fnArial\fs30}but look at it this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在练习领导技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm practicing my leadership skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,指派工作，授权给手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delegation, empowerment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，但是你必须激励大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you can't skip over inspiring others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽心尽力，以身作则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commitment and passion, leading by example.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了…别忘了最要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. And don't forget the all-important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,“从吊床摔下来，然后回去工作”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"falling out of the hammock and getting to work."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小洁，我从网路调出所有资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, jas. I wrangled up all the data from the networks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,并针对不寻常讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ran an analysis for out-of-the-ordinary signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进行即时分析 - 有何发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a real-time basis. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是火山再度苏醒 只是轻微地震活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's just no volcanic reawakening. Just some minor seismic activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，吉米 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jimmy. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好得很，多谢关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, I am peachy. Thanks for asking. Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,红牛、伏特加不是个好组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red bull, vodka, it's not a good, you know, combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的，我一喝就挂了，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot. I didn't make it past sip, did 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没挡头 - 真糗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never do. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔去那里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's bill doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是比尔的私人小岛，小洁 你很清楚协议，我们不能擅自登岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bill's private island, jas. You know the deal, no trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看他在搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go see what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos（278.4，945.4）}艾维克斯生技私人小岛\N离本岛1.2公里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险，禁止进入
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,私人小岛，艾维克斯生技
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有东西把这玩意 从内部打爆冲出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like something punched its way out from inside this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,长约九公尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about 30 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是外骨骼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an exoskeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们有背部凸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had dorsal back convex.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.83,0:12:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮肤护甲，这是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dermal armor. What the hell is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,树林里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something in those trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.65,0:12:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Let's…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:13:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我要以身作则，溜之大吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm gonna start leading by example and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我劝你们也这么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,以希曼！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ishiman! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以希！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, man? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,以希，快点！我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ishi, come on, man! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,以希！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,以希！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以希！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.28,0:14:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住，以希！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, ishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，以希！你行的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, ishi! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以希…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ishi! Ishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小洁，究竟是什么杀了以希？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that thing that killed ishi, jas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图救他，可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to help him, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图救他，我真的尽力了 小洁，可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to help him. I did my best. I did, jas, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing you could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米，去帮我找毕尔特甘墨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to find Burt gummer for me, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？怎么不找崔维斯？ 他们不是搭档吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Well, why not Travis? I mean, they're partners, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔维斯在墨西哥坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travis is in a Mexican jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问了，一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask. Long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你马上出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to head out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.03,0:15:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head out where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后拿到的座标显示 他在巴布亚纽几内亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last coordinates I got for his location are Papua New Guinea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,签证，2019年8月22日
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Mr. gummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生，幸亏是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer. Thank goodness it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚以为会被食人族吃掉 但是应该不会吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a second there, I thought I was gonna get cannibalized, but I'm not, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,五万美金赌她无法再中红心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 50k says she can't do that again. - Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.39,0:17:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我二赔一赌她可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the other side of that action at two to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑头男，你要翻倍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a double-pop, slick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.27,0:17:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我想三赔一，但你肯定没种跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd prefer three to one, actually, but I believe you don't have the balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别被看扁了！上啊！领结仔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step up! Go ahead, bowtie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,三赔一，赌就赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triple-pop. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.41,0:17:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些智障有钱，但脑子坏掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fools have more money than sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔，可不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，领结仔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, bowtie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么，滑头男，你是耶鲁赌博系吗？ 因为你输定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, they teach you how to bet at Yale, slick? 'Cause that's a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜，亲爱的，我不会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, darling, I don't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再翻倍啊，华尔街大亨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, double that bet, wall street!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，我解释一下怎么玩，各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good. Well, then here's the game, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位领结仔先生要过桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. bowtie over here goes across the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,放一颗苹果在头上 我会将苹果射中红心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and puts an apple on his head, and I'ma shoot it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚被点名了，好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - You just got volunteered, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你要背对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And you'll be facing the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着镜子射箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}while looking into a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更有意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that makes it more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会爱死，滑头男 因为赌注追加到25万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna love this, slick, 'cause the bid's just gone up to 250, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,三赔一，不能另开赌盘押输赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}at three to one and we don't do margin betting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,管真多！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有钱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the swag?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.49,0:18:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的安娜，我扑满里的钱更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, darling, I have more in my piggybank. Ohl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我为何雇用她了吧 她是货真价实的狠角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}now you see why I hired her. She's a real piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的净值即将增加75万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to add 750k to your net worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是不少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's a lot of Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有信心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，失误也不会射中你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. If I miss, I'll miss high.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把镜子拿来，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me that mirror, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，领结仔 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bowtie. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个好的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要射准，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她之前搞这套时 我看过有个男的吓到裤底挫屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once saw a guy shit his pants when she did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是百步穿杨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该怀疑我，滑头男！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't have doubted me, slick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正中红心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子，你真是狗屎运…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky, boy. You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那金发女来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what goldilocks wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你在这里待多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you say you've been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,186天，你怎么找到我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}186 days. How'd you track me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔维斯威尔克把你的座标给我老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travis welker gave your coordinates to my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人很贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was very sweet of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turncoat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.15,0:20:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的亲生儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.11,0:20:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我来此是因为 我们需要借助你的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look, I'm here 'cause we need your brand of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜看，是加博虫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. Graboids?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walt, how'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们总是找得到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, they always find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行，我退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time. I'm retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.71,0:20:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，听起来某人有点PTGD\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it sounds like someone's got a little ptgd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博虫后压力症候群 不是创伤后压力症候群\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's post traumatic graboid disorder, not the "stress, " the "graboid, " see…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有句俗谚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know what they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓冥冥中注定 越想躲就越躲不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sometimes finds his destiny on the path to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里比繁文缛节的文明社会好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats the hell out of civilization with all its rules and regs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,内华达州政府叫我去整顿污水道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The state of Nevada ordered me to hook up a sewer…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道那是什么意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理下水道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sanitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,下水道个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanitation, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.87,0:21:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那表示要许可证、政府稽查员、官僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means permits, government inspectors, bureaucracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是自爽用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one big self-licking ice cream cone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府拿到你的身家资料和DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government gets your spore, it gets your DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.51,0:21:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有只怪物杀了我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, one of those things killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.65,0:21:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪，你该去找高手崔维斯威尔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not. Travis welker, he's your go-to man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔维斯威尔克，严格来说，他没空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travis welker, he's, well, he's technically unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事还是千古不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.65,0:21:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是不想想办法的话 会有更多人丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bottom line is, if we don't do something, more people will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one who can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:21:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说是一座岛？ - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}An island, you say? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.71,0:22:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Population?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,八百个当地人，外加研究员与科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight hundred indigenous people, plus researchers and scientists.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，这是你的宿命，甘墨先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's your destiny, Mr. gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.13,0:22:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,宿命烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.56,0:23:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进口非法掠食动物到岛屿保育区？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Importing illegal predators onto an island sanctuary?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,威士忌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whiskey?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来寒暄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a social call.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your island,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里释放了什么动物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did you unleash over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.82,0:23:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟猫似的不停打探\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been snooping like a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚太好奇有何下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what curiosity did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.53,0:23:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有一只今天杀了我一名员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it killed one of my men over there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，小洁，我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, jas. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮什么忙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.71,0:23:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,先从讲实话开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's start with the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有繁殖加博虫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you breed graboids?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.09,0:23:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，比尔，你干了什么好事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, bill, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,打造出无与伦比的打猎体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Created a hunt like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.93,0:23:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进口一只入侵种生物到热带岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've imported an invasive species onto a tropical island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.81,0:23:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管不住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't contain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.02,0:23:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动，小洁 它们很乖，不会离开那座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, jas. They're contained.They're not getting off that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.77,0:23:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且周一早上前就死光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, they'll all be dead by Monday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一共有几只？ - 四只\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many are there? Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.49,0:23:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩三只，我今天发现一只死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three. I found a dead one over there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.07,0:23:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.83,0:24:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以确实被我们杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we did kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.71,0:24:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,生技公司是我的本行，大外宣的招牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, bio-tech's my day job.It's a shingle to hang on my door,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是打猎才是真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but hunting, now that is my passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.30,0:24:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒我自己在食物链中的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It reminds me of my place in the food chain,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.80,0:24:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为当你坐拥财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}see, 'cause when you got wealth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.81,0:24:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下生死存亡有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only currency worth a damn is life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.69,0:24:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻停止打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut this hunt down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.15,0:24:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.57,0:24:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.11,0:24:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向世界野生动物联盟举报你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to report you to the world wildlife federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.53,0:24:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样有点鲁莽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that seems a bit rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.33,0:24:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.95,0:24:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔，我只是难以相信你做出这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe you've done this, bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.79,0:24:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该怎么做就怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta do what you gotta do,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.71,0:24:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你该知道 我切断这周末的对外通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you should know I jammed the comms grid for the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.47,0:24:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准有人破坏我的打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one ruins my hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.76,0:24:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.97,0:25:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这瓶酒吗？ 这是50年的百富威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this whiskey? It's a 50-year-old balvenie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.60,0:25:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,每瓶要价五万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}It costs 50 grand a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.44,0:25:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚问你喝不喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I offered you a glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.48,0:25:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm offering again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.57,0:25:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.90,0:25:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是友情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what friendship looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.00,0:25:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为只是威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, it's just whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.22,0:29:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶毙了，这些童子军猎人真没教养\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. These hunting scouts are savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.18,0:29:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Board this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,花美男不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty boy's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概喝醉跟岛上的妞滚床单去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He probably just got drunk and shacked up with an island chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾维克斯生技
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.22,0:29:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人好像需要刮胡子，和理发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like someone needs a shave. And a haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.15,0:30:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁思敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.23,0:30:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大家叫我“小洁”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go by "jas" now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.57,0:30:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或威尔克博士，随你怎么叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Dr. welker, whichever you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.15,0:30:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不喜欢，她在这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer none of the above. What's she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,替艾维克斯生技进行研发\N{\fnArial\fs30}R&D for avex-bio.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.08,0:30:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派他去找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.54,0:30:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底来干嘛？我本来快乐似神仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell did I come here? I was perfectly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特，跟我谈谈，我们是大人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, talk to me. We're adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.00,0:30:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈谈？那听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk? Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.84,0:30:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开这艘船回到离群索居的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking this boat back to my life of total isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.92,0:30:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特，拜托别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Burt, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.39,0:30:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很久没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.97,0:30:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你没料到有崔维斯这儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Travis was a shock, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.35,0:30:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听到他、你或我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear about him or you or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.10,0:30:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.81,0:30:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谈谈加博虫 讲明确一点，要怎么除掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about graboids, or more specifically, how to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.74,0:30:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.20,0:30:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后我们的对话局限在前寒武纪生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henceforth, we will limit our conversation to precambrian lifeforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.04,0:31:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔克博士，了解吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}understood, Dr. welker?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.92,0:31:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，你们让我很困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on. You guys are melting my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.54,0:31:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩以前交往过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two used to be, like, like a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.47,0:31:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是毕尔特甘墨，我有许多称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Burt gummer, and I've been called many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.43,0:31:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪枝爱好者、怪物猎人、末日准备者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun enthusiast, monster hunter, doomsday prepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.23,0:31:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些标签我斥之以鼻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reject all these labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.81,0:31:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个求生者\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I am is a survivalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.23,0:31:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我踏遍内华达和墨西哥每一处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've scoured the dirt and dust of Nevada and Mexico,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.69,0:31:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,铤而走险，赌命去猎杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting my life oh the line to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.98,0:31:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,名为加博虫的巨型地下食人掠食动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}supersized subterranean man-eating predators called graboids.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.57,0:31:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,结合传统知识与本能来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using a combination of local knowledge, intuition…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.37,0:31:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,屌翻天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frigging awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.91,0:31:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,文明来召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilization comes calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.04,0:31:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我愿意与否\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether I like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.30,0:31:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博虫是长约九公尺的 凶猛地下掠食动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The graboid is a vicious subterranean predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.26,0:31:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,体内构造为半硬式\N{\fnArial\fs30}about 30 feet in length with a semi-rigid internal structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.43,0:31:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它用震动找到猎物 并运用三根强力口内触手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It senses its prey seismically and employs three powerful snake-like oral tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.35,0:32:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,诱捕猎物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ensnare its prey…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.57,0:32:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次差点送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little too close that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪上加霜的是，加博虫生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that weren't enough, graboids give birth to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.32,0:32:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,三只丑陋的后代，称为尖叫兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}three ugly spawn we call shriekers,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.57,0:32:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是短胖矮小又眼盲的两足凶禽\N{\fnArial\fs30}short, squat and blind, bipedal bad boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.74,0:32:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,运用红外线感测与追捕猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sense and hunt their prey using infrared sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.08,0:32:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在唬烂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy can't be for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.75,0:32:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相信我，他是说真的 - …有翅膀的掠食动物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, he's for real. A winged predatory…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.91,0:32:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是认真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, are you guys kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.04,0:32:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特甘墨耶？他让人肃然起敬 是个不得了的传奇人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt gummer? He pulls major respect. He's a freaking legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有当初一半帅 我就刮屁毛且倒着走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I looked half that good, I'd shave my ass and walk backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他蓄胡看起来更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks more badass with the beard, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.84,0:32:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他一脸霸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.80,0:32:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我熟悉又尬意的头壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! That's the dome I know and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.06,0:32:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，人生和生存从这里开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, life and survival starts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.77,0:32:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是假蛇吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a rubber snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.90,0:32:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂尊重隐私啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This your idea of privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.36,0:32:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是丛林，毕尔特，看开点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the jungle, Burt. Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.37,0:33:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,男员工们凑了一些衣物让你穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boys pitched in and got you some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.70,0:33:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作裤、卡其猎衣、标准丛林靴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cargo pants, khaki safari shirt, standard jungle issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.79,0:33:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,算干净吧，还需要什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clean, kind of. Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.96,0:33:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.09,0:33:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.18,0:33:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶，毕尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,皱纹在你身上比在我身上更有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The miles look better on you than my backside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.85,0:33:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用知道你的…皱纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to know about your… your miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.73,0:33:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，你想知道 我们的儿子崔维斯的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Do you want to know about our son, Travis?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.23,0:33:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说吧，崔维斯又下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we must. He's Mia again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.53,0:33:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他携带迷幻蘑菇穿越墨西哥边界 现在在吃牢饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's behind bars for bringing magic mushrooms across the Mexican border.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.95,0:33:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还流行魔菇啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peyote, is that even still a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.03,0:33:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特，过去的流行卷土重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything old is new, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.16,0:33:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的品味一定是受迷幻药 和你的某些基因影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've gotten his taste for psychedelics from the shallow end of your gene pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.16,0:33:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.17,0:33:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,组员等着听情势报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}The team are waiting for a sit rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.84,0:33:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之，有一人在无人火山岛上遇害\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, to recap, there's one kia on an uninhabited volcanic island,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.80,0:34:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们经营国际生技公司的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you think your boss, who happens to run an international biotech company,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.89,0:34:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想方设法弄到且违法孕育\N{\fnArial\fs30}has managed to obtain and illegally gestate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.47,0:34:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博虫的休眠蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}dormant graboid eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.39,0:34:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,试管加博虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Test-tube graboids.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.81,0:34:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太扯了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is folly!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.15,0:34:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有点扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it does seem kind of folly-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.11,0:34:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特，这并不扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not folly, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.48,0:34:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这座岛的唯一途径是过海？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only access to this island is by sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.57,0:34:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人拆掉长尾船的高频无线电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone ripped the hf radios out of the long-tail boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.41,0:34:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔中断对外联系，直到打猎结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill cut us off until his hunt is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.03,0:34:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说我有个不速之客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told I had an interloper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.00,0:34:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔戴维森，亿万慈善家 兼一切奇珍异兽的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill Davidson. Billionaire philanthropist and a hunter of all things exotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.54,0:34:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特甘墨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.34,0:34:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹来我的天堂小岛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings you to my island paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.42,0:34:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来探望一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visiting a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.30,0:34:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把韦瑟比308不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nice weatherby 308.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.30,0:34:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你安装了生物指纹感测锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've installed a biometric fingerprint trigger lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.77,0:34:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全至上 我的打猎行程必备高科技器材\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safety first. It's required tech on all my hunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.56,0:34:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的没错，关于那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.40,0:34:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你让加博虫在私人小岛乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've got graboids loose on your private island,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.48,0:34:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须关闭小岛，打造防御区\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to shut down and create a perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:35:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,岛上居民才不会被活活吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can defend so the native population on this island doesn't get eaten alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.24,0:35:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟小洁说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, like I told jas,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.99,0:35:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那座岛是天然隔离区\N{\fnArial\fs30}that island's a natural containment zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.08,0:35:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博虫专用恶魔岛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alcatraz for graboids?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.80,0:35:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单好记，我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's catchy. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.22,0:35:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特，别大惊小怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry your little head, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.30,0:35:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,周一早上前 那些怪物就会被收拾干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have those bad boys dressed and mounted by Monday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.64,0:35:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你开始猎杀加博虫前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you begin your graboid-slaying quest,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.72,0:35:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮自己一个忙，找把大一点的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}do yourself a favor and get something bigger than that 308.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.06,0:35:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那跟朝着哥吉拉吐口水没两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like spitting at Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.07,0:35:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的，你真逗，毕尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, you're a funny man, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.08,0:35:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我的岛上会乖乖的，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna behave yourself on my island, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.29,0:35:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll catch y'all later. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.30,0:35:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩得开心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.34,0:36:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个该死的小丑会给我们惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ass-clown's a skid Mark on our collective underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.85,0:36:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.39,0:36:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去勘察地形，看看怎么应战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to do recon, see what we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.60,0:36:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要组一支考察队，荷枪实弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we need to organize an expedition team. Get geared up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.27,0:36:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.36,0:36:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷枪实弹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geared up?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.44,0:36:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，要大型武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, weapons. Big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.03,0:36:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,全副武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}The full battle rattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.95,0:36:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有任何军火\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have any munitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.36,0:36:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不尽然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not entirely true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.87,0:36:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有几把利器，一些小刀什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we got a couple sharp objects, some odds and ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.16,0:36:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,小刀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.33,0:36:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有枪械？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're completely gun-less?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.42,0:36:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去看看有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me show you what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.84,0:36:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是二战时期的防空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bomb shelter from world war il.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.55,0:36:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用来储存衣物干料和粮食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just use it to store our dry goods and food supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.02,0:36:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些组员觉得里面闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple team members think it's haunted,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.06,0:36:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得是猴子在生猴宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think it was just a monkey giving birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.52,0:36:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.78,0:37:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.03,0:37:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，看看吧，这些是现有资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take a gander. This is what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.95,0:37:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,最初盖营地时，我发现这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we first started setting up camp here, I found all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.87,0:37:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有刀子和开山刀，超多把开山刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have knives, obviously, and some machetes. Lots of machetes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.63,0:37:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞美上帝，开山刀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, be praised. Machetes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.84,0:37:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天保佑，是把好刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless my soul, Pennsylvania steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.39,0:37:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以派得上用场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That supposed to be good?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.47,0:37:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊在林中大便完 会用小白兔擦屁股吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does a bear shit in the woods and wipe its ass with a white rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.18,0:37:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国陆战队的M2型火焰喷射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}M2 flamethrower used by the us marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.69,0:37:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太平洋战争时征战各岛国时留下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the island-hopping campaigns of the pacific theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.02,0:37:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有效射程20到40公尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effective range, 20 to 40 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.44,0:37:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有超多箱的炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We also have lots and lots of crates of dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.11,0:37:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，从1940年代留到现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, from the 1940s?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.53,0:37:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.61,0:37:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有渗漏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it sweating?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.86,0:37:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸药会渗漏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dynamite sweats?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.95,0:37:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸药未妥善保存 主成分硝化甘油会流出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dynamite improperly stored sweats its main ingredient, nitroglycerine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.62,0:37:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，会让炸药极度不稳定，说爆就爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, which causes it to be highly, and I mean highly, unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.79,0:37:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是最轻微的震动都可能会引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the slightest vibration could set it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.13,0:38:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们能正好利用这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which could actually work to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.29,0:38:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿闻其详\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.38,0:38:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟组员可以将炸药改造成 加博虫触动的绊线陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my crew could turn this tnt into a graboid-activated tripwire.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.09,0:38:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，反渗透系统吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, an anti-infiltration system?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.43,0:38:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，我们会把整个营地 改造成封锁区\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it. We'll turn this whole camp into an area of denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.02,0:38:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,几次爆炸阻止不了加博虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of crash-bangs won't stop a graboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.31,0:38:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但能先挡一会儿 至少警告我们它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but it'll slow it down. Or at least let us know that she's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.94,0:38:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，能交给你跟组员张罗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, can you and your team handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.57,0:38:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的话 我们能用竹子和泡泡糖造出直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we can make a helicopter out of bamboo and bubblegum if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.94,0:38:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.61,0:38:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题，甘墨先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bang it is, Mr. gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.45,0:38:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先拉引线和装炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start by running the firing wire and rigging the clackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.24,0:38:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 这工作很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. That's dangerous work.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.83,0:38:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生于加州阿尔德波因特的大麻农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born on a weed plantation in alder point, California.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.95,0:38:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺命山？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.04,0:38:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我七岁就手持步枪，臀部藏刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a rifle in my hand and a knife on my hip since I was seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.42,0:38:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,12岁成为鹰级童子军 我不是爱好大自然的吃素妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made eagle scouts at 12.I'm not some tree-hugging vegan chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.01,0:38:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀什么就吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I eat what I kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.92,0:38:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀过一些凶猛动物，甘墨先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've killed some serious shit, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.68,0:38:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.39,0:38:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她经验老道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows her stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.77,0:38:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想尽点棉薄之力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna make yourself useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.48,0:39:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要太阳眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use a pair of shades.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.94,0:39:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.65,0:39:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有借有还\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.34,0:40:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.59,0:40:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkeys, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.05,0:40:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜，这只加博虫 要挂在我办公室墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, I want this graboid on my office wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.23,0:40:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你最好清醒一点，滑头男\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better sober up, then, slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.50,0:40:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗…测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.84,0:40:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，艾瑞丝！拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Iris! Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生，你有什么好建议吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mr. gummer. Do you have any Sage advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.97,0:40:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，别干这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.72,0:41:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.39,0:41:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小洁是你什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what is jas to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.40,0:41:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是现在式，是过去式\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not an "is, " she's a "was."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.52,0:41:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了…我也交往过几个女生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Yeah, I got me a few of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.90,0:41:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不了解女人，她们很难捉摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get women. Too many moving parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.82,0:41:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以蒙着眼睛 拆解又重组AK47步枪，可是女人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take apart and reassemble an ak-47 blindfolded, but women,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.41,0:41:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们老是想谈心\N{\fnArial\fs30}they always want to talk about stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.20,0:41:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，谈心很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Talking is tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.70,0:41:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这个能派上用场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you could use one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.16,0:41:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.62,0:41:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.25,0:41:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像是煤坑里的金丝雀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your canary in the coal mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.04,0:41:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会察觉危险，提醒你危机将至\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll sense danger and let you know it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.13,0:41:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,活生生的加博虫警报器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, a living, breathing graboid alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.80,0:41:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.01,0:41:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我还以为你们没有枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I thought you didn't have any guns around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.47,0:41:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不算枪，这是镖弹枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not really a gun. It's a dart rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.89,0:41:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会射出卫星连线标签 电池寿命约72小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It fires a satellite-linked tag with about a 72-hour battery life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.98,0:41:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,射在怪物身上，就能追查它的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we might tag one of those things, so we could track it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.48,0:41:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.12,0:42:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.45,0:42:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭蚊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn mozzies!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.92,0:42:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.34,0:42:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快赶上大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.09,0:43:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒量这么差？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't handle your liquor?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.81,0:43:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险，禁止进入
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.93,0:43:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,私人小岛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.02,0:43:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾维克斯生技 野生动物保育站17号
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.82,0:43:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.44,0:43:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我行的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this. I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.83,0:43:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.29,0:43:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在肚子翻江倒海\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a serious case of swamp-ass going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.29,0:43:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.00,0:44:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.59,0:44:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.81,0:44:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上颚两公尺长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mandible range, two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.31,0:44:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我20几年没见过这些混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen one of these bastards in over 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.89,0:44:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么混蛋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bastards?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.65,0:44:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,演化生命周期的不可测本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assumed the unpredictable nature of the evolutionary lifecycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.44,0:44:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必让粗话变得难以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}had skipped this etymologic stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.49,0:44:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有三只跑出来 可能有九只要对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}If three came out, we could be up against nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.86,0:44:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们繁殖速度跟兔子一样快\N{\fnArial\fs30}They breed like freaking rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.78,0:44:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是无性生殖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They reproduce asexually?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.24,0:44:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点乐趣都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.04,0:44:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，而且它们需要摄取蛋白质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and they need access to protein.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.79,0:44:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大量进食两到五天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After two to five days of gorging themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.58,0:44:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会蜕变长出翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}they molt into their winged brethren,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.63,0:44:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是飞行兽，我要再三强调\N{\fnArial\fs30}the assblasters, which is not, I repeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.92,0:45:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们来说不是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}not good news for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.88,0:45:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦它们能飞天，没有地方是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once they become airborne, no place is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.13,0:45:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我们大概有48小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so we have approximately 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.18,0:45:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止这些怪物 以防它们蜕变且如病毒般蔓延？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stop these things before they molt and spread like a virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.48,0:45:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了，像全球大流行病\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. A viral pandemic.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.31,0:45:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解，但你指的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good to know, but what exactly are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.15,0:45:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖叫兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shriekers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.38,0:45:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博虫不会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A graboid didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.38,0:45:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，是别的玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会埋伏猎杀 先发出震耳欲聋的尖锐声\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're ambush hunters. They make a loud screeching sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.64,0:45:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着才攻击，故得此名\N{\fnArial\fs30}just before they attack, ergo the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.60,0:46:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,头上有一大片骨状膜 像某种红外线摄影机\N{\fnArial\fs30}A large, bony frill on their head is like an infrared camera of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.44,0:46:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们靠热成像猎杀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hunt by heat signature?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.95,0:46:07.03,Title,0,0,0,0,,跟《终极战士》一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.20,0:46:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是玩真的，小子，不是好莱坞童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real life, son, not some Hollywood fairytale.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.54,0:46:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.29,0:46:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.24,0:46:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.74,0:46:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,用声音沟通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bioacoustics.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.37,0:46:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在对彼此说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're speaking to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.33,0:47:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，但是在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but what the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.25,0:47:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔街大亨不见了，比尔 他本来跟在我后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we have lost wall street, bill. He was right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.97,0:47:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,本事不够，别出来丢人现眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna piss like a puppy, you better stay on the porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.81,0:47:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.23,0:48:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.71,0:48:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.80,0:48:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，鸟跟你说的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, the bird told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.59,0:48:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，跟就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.63,0:49:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.95,0:49:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算到有三只尖叫兽溜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count three shriekers still on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.67,0:49:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！有一只加博虫，大家都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move! We've got a graboid. Everyone stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.71,0:49:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么干的好事？ - 尖叫兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did this? Shriekers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.09,0:49:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，但是这个新品种用声音当武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But this new version uses their bioacoustics as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.51,0:50:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,行为突变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behavioral mutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.64,0:50:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.07,0:50:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这王八蛋采防御状态，躲得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This son of a bitch is dug in like a grizzly in December.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.90,0:50:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你搭救，甘墨，但我们要输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the save, gummer, but we're losing the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.24,0:50:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回到防守位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna head back to a defensive position.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.41,0:50:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！我们在它的基地，看那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move! We're right in its wheelhouse. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.95,0:50:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,死掉的树、地面软烂灰黄 它们用甲酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead trees, soft, sallow ground.The formic acid they use to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.50,0:50:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来腐蚀土地，这一整区都酸化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}through this earth has soured this whole area.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.83,0:50:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里像是个大型加博虫游戏围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like one giant graboid playpen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.05,0:50:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你孵化了多少只？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many did you hatch?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.97,0:50:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,四只，死了一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four. One's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.05,0:50:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有改造它们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they juiced?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.14,0:50:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用干细胞科技和基因编辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used stem cell technology and genomic editing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.56,0:50:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,增强它们的掠杀本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}to improve their predatory kill instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.10,0:50:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能够活着离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we make it out of here alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.23,0:50:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操他妈的把你揍到住加护病房！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna open up an extra-large can of whoop ass on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.32,0:50:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我要去引开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna distract it,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.74,0:50:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家同时往不同方向跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you all go at once in different directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.78,0:50:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 它们一次只能追一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Copy. - They can only get us one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.45,0:51:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会用格洛克手枪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You any good with that glock?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.20,0:51:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,指出目标，我一枪击中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a target, I'll hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.41,0:51:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我要尽量把火焰喷射器丢远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm gonna toss this flamethrower as far as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.37,0:51:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,着地时，射它的圆筒，里面都是氮气\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it lands, shoot the small tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.50,0:51:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the nitrogen is stored. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.21,0:51:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.34,0:51:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.42,0:51:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位害羞的女士不想露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this shy lady doesn't want to show her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.34,0:51:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.10,0:51:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，开动了，贱人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, bon appetit, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.83,0:52:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,追捕进行得如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was the hunting party?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.37,0:52:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一刻不得闲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.54,0:52:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的定位镖射到某只怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a GPS dart into something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.42,0:52:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.50,0:52:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么，我们都在追踪中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've been tracking whatever it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.55,0:52:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，尖叫兽都集体行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Shriekers are pack hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.67,0:52:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪一只等于追踪到一整群\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're tracking one, we're tracking the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.97,0:52:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想扫兴，但记得查理吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to be a fly in the buttermilk, but remember Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.64,0:52:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理是何方神圣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell's Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.76,0:52:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理是我们养的一头五千公斤的公象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie. He's our 11, 000-pound bull elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.39,0:52:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上个月帮它装定位标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}we GPS tagged last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.89,0:52:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的位置刚刚更新 离我们的营地一千公尺远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his GPS just refreshed. He's 1, 000 meters from our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.98,0:52:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理的数据在地表下 它在地面下方37公尺处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie's reading is subsurface. He's 37 meters down.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.86,0:53:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它在这里？它不在黑岛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's here? He's not on dark island?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.24,0:53:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我做了3D扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. I did a 3D scan of the mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.95,0:53:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有19公尺长，20几公吨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 19 meters long and weighs over 20 tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.29,0:53:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能，胡扯 加博虫没那么大，它们不会游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it can't be. No, no, no. Graboids aren't that big. They don't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.58,0:53:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗？ - 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that? It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.46,0:53:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有只加博虫离开黑岛，一路游来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of those graboids got off dark island and made its way over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.55,0:53:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还吃了一只五千公斤的大象？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ate an 11, 000-pound elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.17,0:53:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且在保育站正东方一千公尺处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's 1, 000 meters due east of our outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.80,0:53:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，那是比尔的营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, that's bill's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.89,0:53:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我们要去保育站 在那区布置炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we need to get up to the outpost and install that perimeter tripwire.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.77,0:53:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.06,0:53:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔，恐怕有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm afraid it is, bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.23,0:53:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们有两只吃饱的加博虫要对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}because not only are we up against two more juiced graboids,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.32,0:53:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且因为你太蠢 搞出今天害死你那些人的尖叫兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your stupidity has spawned shriekers. That's what killed your men today.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.49,0:53:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，是死伤惨重 还好他们都有签免责声明书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing they all signed waivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.53,0:53:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有听进去？这次打猎要终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hearing me? This hunt has got to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.62,0:53:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行也不会，我从不半途而废\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it doesn't, and it won't.See, I never leave a hunt half done.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.33,0:53:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带走战利品，没人能阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking those trophy mounts, and no one's gonna stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.29,0:53:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道自己在对付什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.75,0:54:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该知道，我要好声好气请你退开 别干涉我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I do. And I'm asking you kindly, step back and let me do what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.59,0:54:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.60,0:54:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.56,0:54:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得你会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of thought you were gonna say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.14,0:54:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们好像陷入僵局？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we're at an impasse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.27,0:54:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧？没枪就是会有这种问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? This is the trouble with not having guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.32,0:54:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔，我劝你收手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word of advice, bill, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.86,0:54:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞砸了，你需要我收拾残局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shit the bed and you need me to clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.41,0:54:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应付得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.87,0:54:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就讲明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.16,0:54:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一只巨型基因强化食肉虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a genetically enhanced giant carnivorous worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.54,0:54:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它挖地道的功力让兔巴哥也自叹不如\N{\fnArial\fs30}with tunneling abilities that puts bugs bunny to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.00,0:54:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在逃出你的小岛，跑来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it escaped your contained island, made its way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.92,0:54:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你今天的表现来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and judging by your performance today,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.00,0:54:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你不知道怎么干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you have the know-how to put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.38,0:54:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样，比尔，你早该打退堂鼓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, bill. You'll be up way past your bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.44,0:54:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安，毕尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.30,0:55:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔，我们这次可能麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, we might've stepped in the shit this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.47,0:55:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该孵化这些怪物 更别说改造它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't have hatched these things, let alone juiced them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.39,0:55:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这物种应该被丢着等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}This species should be left to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.14,0:55:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.23,0:55:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场研发灾难，惨不忍睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's R&D gone bad. Very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.61,0:55:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,打猎是残酷的运动，朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting's a brutal sport, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.90,0:55:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实有个节日叫毕尔特甘墨日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there's actually a Burt gummer day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.24,0:55:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像劳动节或国殇日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like labor day or Memorial Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.66,0:55:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不只个传奇人物 他是某些圈子的超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not just a legend, he's a superhero in some circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.83,0:56:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是有妄想症的激进分子 神经病才会有军火库\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a paranoid militant with more guns and ammo than any sane person should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.57,0:56:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.49,0:56:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信比尔竟然用麻醉枪射你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe bill roofied you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.37,0:56:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信，这些束线带有点恼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it. And these zip-ties are a boil on my backside.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.04,0:56:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's putting it mildly.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.46,0:56:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.67,0:56:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是锯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.29,0:56:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讲明一点，我们需要线锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a finer point on it, we need a friction saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.51,0:56:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,线锯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friction saw, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.55,0:56:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么，你有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you got one?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.26,0:56:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有，可是你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.20,0:57:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.29,0:57:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑王八蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ugly bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.50,0:57:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.73,0:57:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.10,0:57:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，博士，你出去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Why don't you go out there and check, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.15,0:57:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿的靴子是我借你的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.57,0:57:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定这件事重要性何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure how this is relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.36,0:57:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看鞋带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the laces.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.20,0:58:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伞绳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}550 paracord?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.62,0:58:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，因为聪明的末日准备者 都知道要为这种情况做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. 'Cause every smart prepper knows to be prepared for situations like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.83,0:58:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且会把鞋带换成伞绳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and switches out his laces for 550 cord.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.79,0:58:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定在跟我说笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.74,0:58:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把伞绳拉紧，前后摩擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the paracord tight and move it back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.61,0:58:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.66,0:58:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到它吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.46,0:58:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.59,0:58:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的，我什么都看不到！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell, I don't have a visual!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.80,0:58:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是地下怪物，你智障！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an underground creature, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.39,0:59:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.72,0:59:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静，博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.93,0:59:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查斯，别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richards, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.52,0:59:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flare!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.06,0:59:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士，你这样跑死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a dead man running, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.79,0:59:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flare!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.23,0:59:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,夭寿咧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother of god!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.38,1:00:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.97,1:00:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,割断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.09,1:00:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导技巧第三项，创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leadership skill number three, creativity.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.85,1:00:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得猎杀的掠食动物终于出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, a hunt-worthy predator, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.23,1:00:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔，搞什么？你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, bill? You've lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.19,1:00:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到那玩意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.60,1:00:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太壮观了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.94,1:00:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来干这种事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't sign up for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.40,1:00:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能弃我于不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't defect on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.53,1:00:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复理智，比尔，取消这次打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull yourself together, bill, and get out of this hunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.91,1:00:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办不到，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.99,1:00:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.04,1:00:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.29,1:00:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那留下你的武器，那是本公司财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then leave your sidearm. It's the property of avex-bio.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.25,1:00:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.63,1:01:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.92,1:01:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会用得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows you're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.51,1:01:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.47,1:01:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，领结仔，准备来点乐子了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bowtie, you ready for some fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.40,1:01:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下真的惨了，我们被反锁在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're in a real pickle. We're locked in from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.70,1:01:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.13,1:01:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.93,1:01:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来伤口上洒盐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to add salt to the wound?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.51,1:01:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，我来求和的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I've come to make peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.22,1:01:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,打猎队对抗怪物导致多人丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just lost several of our hunting party fighting that thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.10,1:01:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括理查斯博士 比尔恐怕失去理智了\N{\fnArial\fs30}including Dr. Richards, and I'm afraid bill's gone batshit crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.40,1:02:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要帮手，我想加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you could use a spare set of hands, I'd like to throw in.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.78,1:02:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，毕尔特，俗话说众志成城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Burt. They say it takes a village.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.83,1:02:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要一个军队才够力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's gonna take an army.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.50,1:02:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 军队？ - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}An army? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.91,1:02:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚见过女王，跟哥吉拉一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just met the queen, and she's Godzilla-big.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.33,1:02:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我们出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.67,1:02:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，待在这里比出去安全多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're way safer in here than out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.63,1:02:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它引来我们这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You led her right to us!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.51,1:02:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I came to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.72,1:02:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了…这个建物可抵挡核武攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay.This place was built to withstand a nuclear attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.02,1:02:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物不可能进得来，没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way that thing is getting in here. We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.23,1:02:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚怎么说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.78,1:02:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crud.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.90,1:02:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.99,1:02:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，别动，别发出声响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Don't move. Not a sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.71,1:02:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小洁，不行 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jas, don't. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.73,1:03:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁去关掉那东西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody shut that thing off!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.23,1:03:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉发电机，这里会一片漆黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I kill the genny, we'll go dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.61,1:03:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，大家手机拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. Everybody get your cell phones out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.90,1:03:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your flashlights on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.65,1:03:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，关掉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, kill it. Kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.22,1:03:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？饶了我吧，我手机完全没电\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Give me a break. My cell's at 0%.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.26,1:03:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.27,1:03:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸药，可以用那个逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dynamite. That's our ticket out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.23,1:04:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.31,1:04:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们启动发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll fire up that genny,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.40,1:04:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,引那个贱女王进来喝茶吃炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}invite this bitch in for some tea and dynamite,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.52,1:04:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后炸烂这个防空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and blow the hell out of this bomb shelter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.15,1:04:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的点子，老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the way you think, bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.24,1:04:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，计划确定了，尽速行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we've got a plan. Let's get on it pronto.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.99,1:04:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.12,1:04:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hand it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.62,1:04:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.93,1:04:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，这样应该行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I think that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.35,1:04:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我们走去门口，快点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's move towards the door. Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.57,1:04:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.63,1:05:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有火吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a light?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.67,1:05:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走！快走… - 再会了，年轻人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go, go, go! Sayonara, muchacho!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.13,1:05:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.46,1:05:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了三只加博虫 再干掉一只就得救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three dead graboids. Just one more between us and salvation.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.63,1:05:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了尖叫兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget about the shriekers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.92,1:05:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我，我对尖叫兽没齿难忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe you me, as far as shriekers are concerned,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.05,1:05:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,照今天比尔的猎人被吃掉的情况看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a long memory.And the way they feasted on bill's hunters today,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.35,1:05:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在肯定有一整窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure there's a whole litter of them by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.31,1:06:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，这太扯了，比尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is madness, bill!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.56,1:06:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，让你有活着的感觉，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is. Makes you feel alive, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.74,1:06:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们躲起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we just hole up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.12,1:06:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那些怪物猎人解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let the monster hunter handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.87,1:06:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为躲起来 怪物就不会把我们生吞活剥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think holing up will keep that creature from eating us alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.88,1:06:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，可能不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.88,1:06:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？轻松点，领结仔 你的冒险精神到哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Lighten up, bowtie. Where's your sense of adventure, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.76,1:06:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我付钱来打猎，不是现在这局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I paid for a hunt. Not for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.01,1:06:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友，这就是我要提供的服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, my friend, is what I'm gonna give you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.60,1:06:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,千载难逢的打猎行，好好享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hunt of your life. Enjoy it. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.69,1:06:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的起肖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fricking crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.44,1:06:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出胆量，抓紧步枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now grab your balls, and your rifle,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.40,1:06:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我在桥尾会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and meet me at the end of the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.91,1:07:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要干掉几只加博虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna kill some graboids, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.97,1:07:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，炸弹区快布置好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're just about done setting up perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.64,1:07:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要它们跑进来 我们就搞死这些臭鸡掰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of those things get in here, we're gonna frag their asses.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.27,1:07:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.36,1:07:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我们准备好搞死这些臭鸡掰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, we're ready to frag their frigging asses.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.57,1:07:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样，吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.28,1:07:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.36,1:07:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说这种粗话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say things like, "frag their frigging asses."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.91,1:07:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特甘墨说起来很对味 但你不适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt gummer can pull off that stuff, but it's not a good look on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.33,1:07:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sage advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.08,1:07:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰一下，甘墨先生 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Mr. Gummer? Yep?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.41,1:07:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚回收查理的定位标签…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did a recycle on Charlie's GPS tag…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.79,1:07:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只地下大象？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The underground elephant?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.13,1:07:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，它似乎正在比尔的营地生事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it seems like he's causing a bit of trouble in bill's camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.38,1:07:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effing bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.35,1:08:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里完成工作 我去处理比尔的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here and finish up. I'll handle bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.86,1:08:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.24,1:08:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.50,1:08:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.34,1:08:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.31,1:08:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入派对，毕尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the party, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.19,1:08:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.36,1:08:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,求生者才能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The survivalist survives.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.49,1:09:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止，加博虫是岛上最强的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, the graboids are the best damn hunters on this island.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.53,1:09:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠，只剩下你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy hell, is it just you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.16,1:09:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩我跟它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me and it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.91,1:09:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该跟我走了，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for you to come with me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.79,1:09:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怪物是嗜杀成性的杀人机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This creature's an all-go, no-quit killing machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.54,1:09:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't stop till it has you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.08,1:09:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大老远跑来 说一件我早就知道的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came all this way to tell me what I already know?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.63,1:09:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把通讯设备打开，请求支援吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the comms back on and call for backup, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.51,1:09:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着离开这里，你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out of here alive, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.38,1:09:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子没输过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.55,1:09:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人赢得过这些怪物，从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one wins against these things. No one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.76,1:09:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.05,1:09:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没赢，我只是走运才活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not winning, just surviving. I've been lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.18,1:09:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，到此为止，我带你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on, let's call it a day and get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.48,1:09:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它找出来杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find it and kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.23,1:09:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔，别傻了，拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, don't be a damn fool. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.06,1:09:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，比尔！听劝好吗？ 快走，我们不能留在这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, bill!Would you listen to me? Come on, we can't stay here!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.61,1:09:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下来，我非赢不可，毕尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying here. I'm gonna win, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.28,1:09:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托你… - 我要赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… I'm gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.11,1:09:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会赢，来吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one wins. Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.41,1:09:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我…毕尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me. Don't touch me, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.16,1:09:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔…快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill… bill, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.49,1:09:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.46,1:09:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let go! Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.39,1:10:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.93,1:10:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.06,1:10:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它紧咬我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's got me… - Noo chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.20,1:10:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨剧得到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to end here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.33,1:10:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔不只是怪物的食物，也是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill wasn't just a food source, he was an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.70,1:10:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只加博虫就是要他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That graboid wanted him dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.92,1:10:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它怎么没追杀你？你明显是带头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why didn't he come after you? You're obviously the Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.46,1:10:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它从最弱的开始对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's culling the weakest from the herd first.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.13,1:10:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠杯，那我是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap. That means I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.17,1:10:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，这只是早晚的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, it's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.68,1:10:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,加博虫一定会杀到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the graboid works her way over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.76,1:10:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔用他的疯狂科学打开地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so bill and his weird science.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.39,1:10:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在尖叫兽来这里协助女王前\N{\fnArial\fs30}has opened the gates of hell here.We gotta put this place in lockdown before those shriekers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.81,1:10:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个地方封锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}get over here to help their leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.60,1:10:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我们要除掉黑岛上的尖叫兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we've gotta eliminate those shriekers over on dark island.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.56,1:11:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让它们蜕变成无所不至的飞行兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they morph into assblasters and can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.69,1:11:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的，我需要知道方位 我们现在到底在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell. I need orientation. Where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.36,1:11:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是比尔的营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's bill's camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.70,1:11:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等，这是什么？ - 钵状水坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what's this? Devil's punchbowl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.95,1:11:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个第四纪的休火山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an inactive caldera from the quaternary period.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.53,1:11:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,东边的山约八百公尺高\N{\fnArial\fs30}about half a mile east up mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.54,1:11:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面是高原吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a plateau above it? Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.62,1:11:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是一决胜负的好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like a good place to end this fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.71,1:11:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢精彩的决战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a good last stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.13,1:11:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何选这处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why there?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.21,1:11:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它引到通往火山口的崖边 然后炸到稀巴烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lead it over the cliff into the caldera and blow it to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.00,1:11:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔和厄尔30年前用过这招 我们也可以照用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked for val and Earl 30 years ago, it'll work for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.17,1:11:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，华尔和厄尔是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, who's val and Earl?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.47,1:11:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个旧识\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of guys I used to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.05,1:11:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟组员能将炸药 事先安装在火山口吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, can you and your team pre-rig the caldera with the tnt?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.56,1:11:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊在林中大便完 会用小白兔擦屁股吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does a bear shit in the woods and wipe his ass with a white rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.44,1:11:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好奇怪，直接讲重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are weird. Just skip to the good part.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.81,1:11:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在气温是摄氏30度 中午会达37度以上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so right now, it's at 86 fahrenheit. At noon, it'll be 100 plus.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.78,1:11:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么利用这点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that good?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.03,1:11:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一般人体温是37度\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause regular human body temperature is 98.6.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.53,1:11:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果环境温度超过的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the environmental temperature exceeds that,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.99,1:11:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上来说，尖叫兽的热成像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}then theoretically speaking, the shriekers' heat vision…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.12,1:11:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…碰上恒温哺乳动物，效果会变差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will be less effective when it comes to warm-blooded mammals.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.41,1:11:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，找到怪物位置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they found shade.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.75,1:12:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖叫兽的卫星标签在海下洞穴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The satellite tag on the shrieker places them inside the sub-oceanic cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.42,1:12:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行动我们大概要分头进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I think we're gonna have to split the team on this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.59,1:12:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特，我和你应该突袭尖叫兽… 用蓝波的手法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, you and I should ambush the shriekers… Rambo style.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.14,1:12:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我跟吉米去洞穴跟尖叫兽交手\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Jimmy and I will engage the shriekers in the cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.22,1:12:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能拿电锯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, can I have the chainsaw?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.35,1:12:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我拿火焰枪，准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I'll keep the flame unit. You ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.98,1:12:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做好万全准备！大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so ready! I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.36,1:12:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导技巧第四项，勇气与承担责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leadership skill number four, courage and commitment.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.78,1:12:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，对讲机开第一频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stay on your walkie-talkie channel one.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.83,1:12:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Channel one.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.08,1:12:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.46,1:12:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要，我有充分准备，别大惊小怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to be careful. I'm prepared.Stop fussing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.42,1:12:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，那件事我很抱歉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm sorry about…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.55,1:12:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.80,1:12:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.43,1:12:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞒着你儿子的事是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was wrong not to share our son with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.10,1:12:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时还年轻，不希望你被困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was young and I didn't want you to feel trapped into something.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.56,1:13:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕你是没做好准备或不想要都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you weren't ready for or didn't want.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.61,1:13:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understatement.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.69,1:13:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才会独力扶养\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I went it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.53,1:13:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都尽力而为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do the best we can with what we got.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.45,1:13:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改变心意了 我办不到，芙芮迪，我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I changed my mind. I can't do this, Freddie. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.07,1:13:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在夺命山长大 没种过大麻，或射杀松鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wasn't raised on murder mountain, growing weed or shooting squirrels.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.20,1:13:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是单亲妈妈养大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was raised by a single mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.91,1:13:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思喔，单亲妈妈超强的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Single moms are totally badass.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.37,1:13:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，大概吧，但我是郊区的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, maybe, but I was a kid in the suburbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.46,1:13:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈穿粉红色制服 上面有一颗小牙齿图案\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom wears pink scrubs with a little white toothy logo,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.76,1:13:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是口腔卫生师，我只是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's a dental hygienist. I'm just a…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.84,1:13:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，不许你那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calate, okay? Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.22,1:13:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再有自怨自艾的负面想法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let those negative self-loathing thoughts leave your head again, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.31,1:13:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以问你一个问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.18,1:13:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不行的话有差吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I said no, would it matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.98,1:13:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的喜欢单打独斗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this "go it alone" thing really work for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.62,1:13:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了，苗条妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go, slim.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.79,1:14:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那副雷朋眼镜别弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't lose those ray-bans.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.33,1:14:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了，蓝波小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's go, ram-boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.08,1:14:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是当今世上最强悍的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the baddest man alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.67,1:14:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你妈可能用过那种尖锐工具…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your mom, she probably used that sharp tool…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.18,1:14:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,刮除器、牙齿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scraper, the tooth, the…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.55,1:14:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙菌斑刮除器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plague scraper.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.68,1:14:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个，有必要的话 她一定会用那个痛宰尖叫兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that. I bet you she'd shove it up a shrieker's ass if she had to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.39,1:14:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，小子！出发！你守着基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, son! Move out! You hold down the fort.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.65,1:14:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让加博虫找你麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let that graboid give you any crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.36,1:14:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去干掉它们，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get them, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.35,1:15:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，蓝波小子，走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, ram-boy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.37,1:16:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has gotta be the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.25,1:16:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果三只尖叫兽上回没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If three shriekers survived that last battle,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.50,1:16:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在至少要对付九只了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna be up against at least nine by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.05,1:16:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛放亮一点，蓝波小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes peeled, ram-boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.01,1:16:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，甘墨先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, Mr. gummer.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.68,1:16:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.97,1:16:27.23,Title,0,0,0,0,,把泥巴涂在身上 阿诺在《终极战士》里的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting mud on me like Arnold did in predator.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.31,1:16:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望怪物看见我的热成像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't want those creatures seeing my heat signature.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.23,1:16:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，涂上泥巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, mud up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.94,1:16:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点子不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a terrible idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.15,1:16:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在巴不得有一件专业防护衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I wouldn't give for a mylar poncho right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.75,1:16:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.55,1:17:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Movement.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.72,1:17:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.18,1:17:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,正前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.14,1:17:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.14,1:17:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一招都必须是致命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every blow you strike has to be a kill shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.35,1:17:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击下腹部，腿、脚、鼠蹊部\N{\fnArial\fs30}The underbelly is what you want, legs, feet, groin,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.32,1:17:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有脆弱部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the soft stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.11,1:17:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击鼠蹊部，了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for the groin. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.24,1:17:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,用野蛮手法对付这些丑八怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go medieval on these ugly slime bags.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.32,1:17:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为要走蓝波路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were going Rambo.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.79,1:17:29.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,你走蓝波路线 我是电锯，走《尸变》路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh…You go Rambo. I've got the chainsaw. I'm going evil dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.87,1:17:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.33,1:17:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，等等…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready. Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.46,1:17:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.54,1:17:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳塞，怪物用声音当武器，记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ear protection. These guys use sound as a weapon, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.34,1:17:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.85,1:17:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我，小子！来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me, boy! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.60,1:17:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杀怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.40,1:18:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生？先别跑太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer? Don't get too far now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.12,1:19:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别作梦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you try!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.77,1:20:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，大伙们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.94,1:20:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.21,1:20:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，不算太糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that wasn't too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.67,1:20:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.22,1:20:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，甘墨先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Mr. gumm…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.50,1:21:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,到高处，重复，立刻爬上高处！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to high ground! I repeat, get to high ground now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.17,1:21:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝波小子，你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, ram-boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.04,1:21:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.59,1:21:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死这把火焰枪了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm loving this flame unit!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.23,1:22:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有把好刀，谁需要枪啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who needs guns when you got Pennsylvania steel?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.35,1:23:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不希望被炸烂，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to lose that nice figure now, do we?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.44,1:23:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有敌人的迹象，很安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of our Nemesis. It's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.07,1:23:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，异常安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's weirdly quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.95,1:23:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生，我是芙芮迪，收到请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer, it's Freddie. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.00,1:23:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，芙芮迪 我是毕尔特，收到请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Freddie. Go for Burt. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.79,1:23:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬头看左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look up and to the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.21,1:23:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随便瞎猜 加博虫女王终于现身了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take a wild guess.Queen graboid finally showed up?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.80,1:23:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，它来了，在你们正下方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she did, and she's right underneath you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.51,1:24:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,12公尺以下，你们正下方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve meters down. I mean, right beneath you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.89,1:24:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家在哪里？小洁没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody? Is jas all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.22,1:24:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不关心我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd never ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.35,1:24:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！待在原地！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move! Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.27,1:24:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来这里，小洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here, jas.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.15,1:24:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.61,1:24:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Anna?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.86,1:24:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,水塔，甘墨先生，上头都没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water tower, Mr. gummer. All good up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.71,1:24:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在…小洁，叫他离开地面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… Jas, get him off the ground!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.63,1:24:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在等我，对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been waiting for me, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.77,1:24:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.39,1:24:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，钵状水坑准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Devil's punchbowl, is it ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.44,1:24:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或多或少吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.65,1:24:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上给我准备好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it ready now!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.44,1:24:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，甘墨先生，那边见，完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, Mr. gummer. See you there. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.57,1:25:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，小心，待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Easy as you go. See you there shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.53,1:25:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what now?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.12,1:25:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都离开这里 我跟你在那边会面，马上走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out of here. Both of you.I'll meet you there. Go, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.75,1:25:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，等等，怪物会跟着我们吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Walt, isn't that thing gonna follow us?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.50,1:25:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会，我才是母虫要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. That mother wants me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.88,1:25:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上走，快离开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now skedaddle. Go. Scat!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.31,1:25:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次不用单打独斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to go it alone this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.85,1:25:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我行的，苗条妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got this, slim.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.52,1:25:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，但是万一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but what happens if…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.65,1:25:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.36,1:25:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one hell of an if.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.20,1:25:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但万一出事了 你跟我们的废物儿子可以继承\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if so, then you and that ne'er-do-well son of ours stand to inherit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.37,1:25:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,两千加仑汽油、五年份用水\N{\fnArial\fs30}2, 000 gallons of petrol, a five-year supply of water,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.88,1:25:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千份战斗口粮 和把内华达州炸飞的军火\N{\fnArial\fs30}3, 000 mres and enough munitions to blow the state of Nevada to kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.63,1:25:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很吸引人的组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice portfolio.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.30,1:26:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能拿回太阳眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you get these sunglasses back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.51,1:26:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打断你交代遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to interrupt your last will and testament,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.97,1:26:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们要走了，甘墨先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we gotta do this, Mr. gummer.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.22,1:26:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.72,1:26:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你要不要，我都跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whether you like it or not, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.15,1:26:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.27,1:26:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 你跟小洁走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Now, you'll go with jas,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.40,1:26:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们约在钵状水坑见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll rendezvous at the devil's punchbowl,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.94,1:26:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，去吧，快\N{\fnArial\fs30}now skedaddle. Go, go, go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.92,1:26:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，大块头，只剩你跟我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, big guy. Just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.22,1:26:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们携手共度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mano-a-mano.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.27,1:26:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,天国
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.98,1:27:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,宿命烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.07,1:29:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's up!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.99,1:29:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甘墨先生？ - 又是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer? You again?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.91,1:29:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，计划是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.75,1:29:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是引它来攻击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan is to get her to charge us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.38,1:29:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它引到悬崖边就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We draw her to the edge of the cliff and over.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.09,1:29:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们在最后一秒快闪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we lunge out of the way at the last second?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.42,1:29:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸如此类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.94,1:29:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，蓝波小子 要么带头，要么服从或离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, ram-boy.So lead, follow, or get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.28,1:29:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.41,1:29:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.50,1:30:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能选这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.58,1:30:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要选服从或离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your options are to follow or get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.13,1:30:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，我身手较敏捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.00,1:30:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我比较聪明 - 我比较年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wiser. I'm younger.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.09,1:30:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…这点我认输\N{\fnArial\fs30}L… you got me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.88,1:30:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就联手行动，同意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teamwork, then. Can we settle on that?Vaya con diablo, mija.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.97,1:32:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.14,1:33:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.65,1:33:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.78,1:33:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.33,1:33:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.52,1:33:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.52,1:33:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，他本来在我旁边，然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. He was right next to me, and then…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.10,1:33:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.98,1:33:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特？毕尔特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt? Burt?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.19,1:34:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕尔特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.61,1:34:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘墨先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. gummer!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.78,1:34:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.26,1:39:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs80\pos（960，579）}4月14日要过毕尔特甘墨日…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.76,1:39:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs80\pos（936，565）}…而且别忘了缴税
